_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T13:07:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234185","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866890-1842212951297277","game_id":"steam-4866890","kind":"announcement","title":"Terraformer Wars - 16 BIT NIGHTS Game Showcase 2027","summary":"Hey Folks, Gather around the fire, we have some BIG news for you. Our Game Terraformer Wars is now oficially part of the upcoming game showcase we plan to deliver in 2027. The game marathon chalange consist in 4 new projects, yes, not 1, not 2, not 3, BUT 4! Want to know more ? Here is our official video news about it: While you are there, feel free to SMASH that YouTube subscribe button for future news, trailers, and devblogs. Now that the Phase 1: coming soon pages debut is finished, we are mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T15:18:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4866890-1841579228666468","game_id":"steam-4866890","kind":"announcement","title":"We are LIVE","summary":"Good news, folks,Our Dune-inspired autobattler Steam Page is now live! For those of you who don't know, Terraformer Wars is an autobattler with a unique take on veteran units. In the future, mega-corporations send Terraformer colossal machines to fight over dominance on faraway planets. This is the final reveal from our 4 games developed during the same-time marathon. Now, the first phase is over, all coming soon pages for all 4 projects are doneNext going to phase 2: to finish demos; then phase","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T18:00:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"ht